 1721                   
 1722                   ; Read one sector from disk.
 1723                   ; Return a 00h in A if the operation completes properly, and 01h if an error occurs during the read.
 1724                   ; Disk number in 'diskno' (4..7)
 1725                   ; Track number in 'track' (0..255)
 1726                   ; Sector number in 'sector' (0..63)
 1727                   ; DMA address in 'dmaad' (0-65535)
 1728                   ; 
 1729                   ; LBA
 1730                   ; 00000000 00000000 00000000
 1731                   ; 00000000 tttttttt ssssssdd
 1732                   ;        E        B        C
 1733                   
